# ProgressBar 进度条

**Category**: react
**URL**: http://localhost:3000/cn/docs/react/components/progress-bar
**Source**: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/heroui-inc/heroui/refs/heads/v3/apps/docs/content/docs/cn/react/components/(feedback)/progress-bar.mdx
> 进度条用于展示某项操作随时间变化的确定或不确定进度。


***

## 引入

```tsx
import { ProgressBar, Label } from '@heroui/react';

```

### 用法

```tsx
import {Label, ProgressBar} from "@heroui/react";

export function Basic() {
  return (
    <ProgressBar aria-label="加载中" className="w-64" value={60}>
      <Label>加载中</Label>
      <ProgressBar.Output />
      <ProgressBar.Track>
        <ProgressBar.Fill />
      </ProgressBar.Track>
    </ProgressBar>
  );
}

```

### 组件结构

```tsx
import { ProgressBar, Label } from '@heroui/react';

export default () => (
  <ProgressBar value={60}>
    <Label>Loading</Label>
    <ProgressBar.Output />
    <ProgressBar.Track>
      <ProgressBar.Fill />
    </ProgressBar.Track>
  </ProgressBar>
);

```

